# GuitarFreaks 9th Mix: power-on after the install (start from gtrfrk9m-install's NVRAM). NOTE 605
# (RTC-RAM cleared): Test goes on. The boot checks: the CD drive, the RTC data, the devices, then
# the data loaded from the CD and initialised. Hashes the main RAM every frame and snapshots every
# 60 frames.
game gtrfrk9m

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

at 900 press "Service Mode" 8
from 0 every 60 snap
at 24000 quit
